     1085        RECT-8 AT ROW 12.75 COL 2.5 WIDGET-ID 10
     1086        RECT-6 AT ROW 1.25 COL 35 WIDGET-ID 22
     1087        RECT-9 AT ROW 7 COL 2.5 WIDGET-ID 36
     1088        RECT-7 AT ROW 5 COL 35 WIDGET-ID 60
     1089        RECT-10 AT ROW 16.25 COL 67.5 WIDGET-ID 68
     1090       WITH 1 DOWN NO-BOX KEEP-TAB-ORDER OVERLAY
